-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ג'1: the work-week table of a
-- teacher in the reform's part application in תשע"ב (§26(ב) sends a
-- part-time teacher to it); the 60-minute hour of its presence; its notes
-- on frontal hours that are not whole and on fewer than 4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g2`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g3`

§ `נספח ג'1`

-- The title ("טבלאות שבוע עבודה למורים ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה בשנת
-- הלימודים תשע"ב") and the table: a teacher in the part application in
-- תשע"ב, from the full position §26(א) composes for the year (24 frontal,
-- 2 individual and 4 teaching-support hours, as §26 holds it) down to 7
-- frontal hours, a frontal hour less a column.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1/p1 akn:att_10__hc_1/t1
`the table of annex ג'1` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ג'1"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band under 50`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 24 2 4 30,
            `an Oz annexed column` (95.00%) 23 2 3.5 28.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (91.67%) 22 2 3.5 27.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (86.67%) 21 2 3 26,
            `an Oz annexed column` (83.33%) 20 2 3 25,
            `an Oz annexed column` (78.33%) 19 1.5 3 23.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (75.00%) 18 1.5 3 22.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (70.00%) 17 1.5 2.5 21,
            `an Oz annexed column` (66.67%) 16 1.5 2.5 20,
            `an Oz annexed column` (63.33%) 15 1.5 2.5 18,
            `an Oz annexed column` (58.33%) 14 1 2.5 17.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (53.33%) 13 1 2 16,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 12 1 2 15,
            `an Oz annexed column` (45.00%) 11 1 1.5 13.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (41.67%) 10 1 1.5 12.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (36.67%) 9 0.5 1.5 11,
            `an Oz annexed column` (33.33%) 8 0.5 1.5 10,
            `an Oz annexed column` (28.33%) 7 0.5 1 8.5

-- The asterisk under the table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§26(י), as §9(יא)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching
-- period as the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1/p2
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex ג'1 asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex ג'1 changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The first note: frontal and role hours that are not whole take the
-- individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and the
-- position is all the hours over the full position's (common: `the week
-- the annexed table gives`, `the position of the week in the annexed
-- table`).
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1/p3
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what the table of annex ג'1 gives for` f IS
    `what the annexed table gives for` `the table of annex ג'1` f

-- The second note: a teacher with fewer than 4 frontal hours (with his
-- homeroom and role hours) works frontal hours only, his position his
-- hours over "בסיס המשרה ברפורמה ביישום חלקי בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב" — the
-- year's full position under §26(א), the table's own. "בפחות מ-4" leaves 4
-- out.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1/p4
`the fewest frontal hours annex ג'1 keeps whole` MEANS 4

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER @desc frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex ג'1 gives a teacher with` f IS
    `what the annexed table gives, frontal hours only below` `the table of annex ג'1` `the fewest frontal hours annex ג'1 keeps whole` f

-- F-oz-founding-annex-g1-a: the second note keeps a teacher below 4
-- frontal hours to frontal hours only, and the table's last column is 7
-- frontal hours (annex ג'2's is 6, annex ג'3's 5): 4 to 6 frontal hours in
-- תשע"ב, 4 and 5 in תשע"ג and 4 in תשע"ד are in no column and under no
-- note. The text is silent, and the encoding gives such a week no answer
-- (convention thresholds.missing-row): a column the table does not print
-- is not made up from its neighbours.
`why annexes ג'1–ג'3 give no week from 4 frontal hours to their last column` MEANS
    `the text is silent` "F-oz-founding-annex-g1-a"

`annexes ג'1–ג'3 give no week from 4 frontal hours to their last column` MEANS
        `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ג'1` EQUALS 7
    AND `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ג'2` EQUALS 6
    AND `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ג'3` EQUALS 5
    AND `the fewest frontal hours annex ג'1 keeps whole` EQUALS 4
    AND `the fewest frontal hours annex ג'2 keeps whole` EQUALS 4
    AND `the fewest frontal hours annex ג'3 keeps whole` EQUALS 4
    AND all (GIVEN f YIELD isNothing (`what annex ג'1 gives a teacher with` f)) (LIST 4, 5, 6)
    AND all (GIVEN f YIELD isNothing (`what annex ג'2 gives a teacher with` f)) (LIST 4, 5)
    AND isNothing (`what annex ג'3 gives a teacher with` 4)
#ASSERT `annexes ג'1–ג'3 give no week from 4 frontal hours to their last column`

§§ `נספח ג'1 -- the checks`

-- The table opens at the full position, and its columns step down a
-- frontal hour at a time.
#ASSERT `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ג'1`
#ASSERT `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ג'1`

-- Its arithmetic: every position is its column's hours over the 30, and
-- every presence its hours — but the tenth column's: 15 frontal, 1.5
-- individual and 2.5 teaching-support hours are 19 hours, which the
-- position printed above them (63.33%, 19 of 30) counts, and the presence
-- prints 18 (F-oz-founding-annex-g-a; the hours decide).
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ג'1` EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the table of annex ג'1` `the presence row` 10 18
#ASSERT `what annex ג'1 gives a teacher with` 15 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 15 1.5 2.5) (63.33%) (63.33%))

§§ `נספח ג'1 -- illustrations`

-- 23 frontal hours: 28.5 hours of 30, 95%.
#ASSERT `what annex ג'1 gives a teacher with` 23 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 23 2 3.5) (95%) (95%))
-- 6.5 frontal hours: the note's nearest column is 7's.
#ASSERT `what annex ג'1 gives a teacher with` 6.5 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 6.5 0.5 1) (8 DIVIDED BY 30) (8 DIVIDED BY 30))
-- 3 frontal hours: frontal hours only, 3 of 30.
#ASSERT `what annex ג'1 gives a teacher with` 3 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 3 0 0) (10%) (10%))
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex ג'1 changes the length of a teaching period`
